  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Fixed\n- The default job log folder is now per-user ($XDG_STATE_HOME/credfeto-build-mcp/logs, else ~/.local/state/credfeto-build-mcp/logs, else a credfeto-build-mcp-<uid> folder in the temp directory) and is created owner-only (0700) when BUILD_MCP_LOG_DIR is unset, so users on a shared machine no longer share job logs (#17)\n- The solution builds again: long methods in the .NET server DotnetDetector and CleanupFileSelector are split into smaller methods to satisfy the MA0051 method-length analyzer (refactor only, no behaviour change) (#17)",
